            "raw_output": "=== surya_aws_s3_train.csv: valid ref timesteps=439,071\n  tol=  4d:  6279 samples | M/X= 558 | median delta=0 days 00:06:00\n  tol=  1h:  6183 samples | M/X= 552 | median delta=0 days 00:06:00\n  tol= 12m:  6026 samples | M/X= 537 | median delta=0 days 00:05:00\n      per-year: {2010: np.int64(80), 2011: np.int64(1082), 2013: np.int64(1205), 2014: np.int64(1525), 2015: np.int64(1155), 2016: np.int64(180), 2017: np.int64(245), 2018: np.int64(7), 2019: np.int64(25), 2020: np.int64(82), 2021: np.int64(440)}\n      M/X per-year: {2010: np.int64(6), 2011: np.int64(100), 2013: np.int64(100), 2014: np.int64(148), 2015: np.int64(104), 2016: np.int64(9), 2017: np.int64(39), 2020: np.int64(2), 2021: np.int64(29)}\n\n=== surya_aws_s3_val.csv: valid ref timesteps=19,932\n  tol=  4d:   321 samples | M/X=  29 | median delta=0 days 00:06:00\n  tol=  1h:   309 samples | M/X=  29 | median delta=0 days 00:05:00\n  tol= 12m:   299 samples | M/X=  28 | median delta=0 days 00:05:00\n      per-year: {2011: np.int64(13), 2013: np.int64(9), 2014: np.int64(74), 2015: np.int64(74), 2016: np.int64(19), 2017: np.int64(6), 2019: np.int64(5), 2021: np.int64(2), 2023: np.int64(97)}\n      M/X per-year: {2011: np.int64(1), 2014: np.int64(11), 2015: np.int64(7), 2023: np.int64(9)}\nShell cwd was reset to /home/jovyan/tmp/surya_workshop/downstream_apps/flare_forecast/old-chats-notebooks",
