567\n  val  0 2011-01-21T04:17     flipped 0.241454     0.457567\n  val  1 2011-01-21T12:15     upright 0.248800     0.482297\n  val  1 2011-01-21T12:15     flipped 0.264450     0.482297\n\n                      error  persistence\nsplit orientation                       \ntrain flipped      0.236621     0.428961\n      upright      0.218160     0.428961\nval   flipped      0.252952     0.469932\n      upright      0.238477     0.469932\n\npersistence gap across orientations: 0.000e+00  (must be ~0)\nmean error, flipped minus upright: +0.0165\nper-sample flipped minus upright:\nsplit  i\ntrain  0    0.017414\n       1    0.019507\nval    0    0.013300\n       1    0.015651\n\npeak GPU memory: 11.4 GB of 44 GB\n[  159.6s] DONE\n\n[exited with code 0]\n--- end ---\n-rw-r--r--. 1 jovyan jovyan 5763 Sep 17 13:20 /tmp/run_flip_check.py",
