            "raw_output": "24 markdown '## To LoRA or not to Lora\\n\\nThis cell gives you two options. '\n25 code '# Three fine-tuning regimes, all selected from the model: se'\n26 markdown '### Forced flip pass: does a flipped stack reach the model, '\n27 code '# Force one upright and one flipped pass through the model, '\n28 markdown '### The small check: flips through the real pipeline, before'\n29 code '# Small end-to-end flip check. Runs at batch size 1 througho'\n30 markdown 'We can now test that this model manipulates a batch as expec'\n31 markdown '### batch -- skip once its run once!'\n32 code 'batch = next(iter(train_data_loader))\\noutput = model.forward'\n33 markdown '## Define your metrics\\n\\nMetrics are a very important part of'\n34 code 'from downstream_apps.flare_forecast.metrics.flare_metrics im'\n35 code 'train_loss_metrics = FlareMetrics(\"train_loss\")\\n# val_loss i'\n36 markdown \"Now they can be evaluated in our model's output and our grou\"\n37 code '# batch[\"forecast\"] is (B, 13, 1, 4096, 4096) \u2014 the 1 is the'\n38 markdown 'Then a training evaluation that will not backpropagate and i'\n39 code 'train_evaluation_metrics(output, target)'\n40 markdown 'In the validation evaluation metrics we report both MSE and '\n41 code 'validation_evaluation_metrics(output, target)'\n42 markdown '## Define your PyTorch ligthning module\\n\\nIn this workshop we'\n43 code 'from downstream_apps.flare_forecast.lightning_modules.pl_fla'\n44 code 'class Flare2DLightningModule(FlareLightningModule):\\n    \"\"\"F'\n45 markdown '## Set your global seeds\\n\\nSince training AI models generally'\n46 code 'L.seed_everything(42, workers=True)'\n47 markdown '## Intialize Lightning module\\n\\nNow we properly initalize the'\n48 code \"metrics = {\\n    'train_loss': train_loss_metrics,\\n    'val_l\"\n49 markdown '## Logging\\n\\nIn order to properly compare experiments against'\n50 code 'project_name = cfg.wandb_project\\nfrom datetime import dateti'\n51 markdown '## Initialize trainer\\n\\nWith the loggers done, now the traine'\n52 code 'train_data_loader.dataset.flip_probability = 1.0'\n53 code 'max_epochs = 2\\n\\n# ------------------------------------------'\n54 markdown '## Fit the model\\n\\nFinally we fit the model.  We pass the Lig'\n55 code 'trainer.fit(lit_model, train_data_loader, val_data_loader)'\n56 markdown '### checking after it runs - draft image'\n57 code '# =========================================================='\nShell cwd was reset to /home/jovyan/tmp/surya_workshop/downstream_apps/flare_forecast/old-chats-notebooks",
