      "body": "two things: \n\n- Why does the plot happen before the model runs? im confused lol\n- i wanna do another small check: id like to confirm that the whole process (training/validation/testing) can handle BOTH flipped and not flipped images. right now when we set probability to 1 or 0 it does either all flips or all no flips, is that correct? ialso need the check for both (ie i need to plot one that was flipped and one that wasn't flipped), by check i mean the cell im plotting at the end"
    },
