      "raw_time": false,
      "body": "i need to know how the model will run but i just need to have SOME results first, not necessrily all the instruction thoughts. so the 4 runs we're doing, here's an idea: for that 1 hr dry run we're trying, what's the expected output time it'll take if instead of 4 runs we do just 1 run with those 87 flares? clearly lay out plan (like with the tbales or bullet points). i dont think we need you to run anything in terminal or anything since the memory should already be there right?",
      "type": "msg",
